  *Transactions (confirmed via `get_transactions`, cross-checked on roster)* — LA traded LB Jared Verse plus 2027/2028/2029 first/second/third-round picks to Cleveland for DE Myles Garrett; roster pull confirms Garrett is now active on LA's roster and Verse is gone. GB's roster confirms Micah Parsons (OLB, RES) and Zaire Franklin (acquired from Indianapolis) are on the team, and transactions show GB hired Jonathan Gannon as DC while LaFleur/Gutekunst/Ball all got extensions. ATL's transactions show the franchise fired HC Raheem Morris and GM Terry Fontenot in January 2026, hired Matt Ryan as "president of football," and signed both Tua Tagovailoa and Cooper Rush — roster confirms three veteran-caliber QBs plus a rookie on the depth chart. DAL added DL Rashan Gary via trade and restructured/extended Prescott, Lamb, and Tyler Smith.

